' 4+1 process view - Player books a slot (US18, T03) · pitch lock, exclusion constraint and outbox in the same transaction
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes code and whoever debugs.
' Documented decision: Pitch lock, exclusion constraint and outbox in the same transaction (ADR 0003, ADR 0004).
' Not drawn: internal detail of the classes; refusals that do not change the sequence (they are in the text of process.md).
@startuml process-book
!include ../style.puml

title Process view - player books a slot (US18, T03): pitch lock, exclusion constraint and outbox in the same transaction
autonumber

participant "Booking" as WEB_F_BOOKING
box "ASP.NET Core API"
  participant "Single booking" as API_BOOK_SINGLE
  participant "Accounts" as API_AUTH_ACCOUNTS
  participant "Pitch lock" as CC_LOCK
  participant "Slot check" as CC_SLOTCHECK
  participant "Put in the outbox" as API_NOTIF_OUTBOX
  participant "Booking store" as API_BOOK_STORE
end box
database "PostgreSQL" as C_DB

WEB_F_BOOKING -> API_BOOK_SINGLE : POST /api/bookings { pitchId, startsAt } [apiJson, through the\nNext.js rewrites; Player policy]
API_BOOK_SINGLE -> API_BOOK_SINGLE : Validates the request (400 validation_failed)
API_BOOK_SINGLE -> C_DB : Reads the pitch and the club, outside a transaction (404 pitch_not_found)\n[SELECT pitches JOIN clubs]
API_BOOK_SINGLE -> API_AUTH_ACCOUNTS : Is the club's owner active? (422 club_unavailable)
API_AUTH_ACCOUNTS -> C_DB : users.deactivated_at IS NULL [SELECT]

group Lock transaction (READ COMMITTED)
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> CC_LOCK : LockAsync(pitchId)
  CC_LOCK -> C_DB : BEGIN; SELECT 1 FROM pitches WHERE id = … FOR UPDATE [SQL]
  note over CC_LOCK, C_DB: Another request for the same pitch (booking, block, cancellation, no-show, price\nband) waits here.
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> C_DB : Reads the pitch again inside the lock [SELECT pitches (+ schedule,\nbands)]
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> CC_SLOTCHECK : CheckAsync(pitch, timeZone, startsAt, now)
  CC_SLOTCHECK -> C_DB : Is there an overlapping block? [SELECT blocks]
  CC_SLOTCHECK --> API_BOOK_SINGLE : The slot, or the 1st refusal: 422 pitch_inactive,\noutside_booking_window, invalid_slot, slot_started; 409\nslot_blocked
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> API_BOOK_SINGLE : Booking.ForPlayer(…, pitch.PriceForSlot(startsAt, timeZone),\nnow)
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> API_NOTIF_OUTBOX : EnqueueConfirmationAsync, EnqueueOwnerNotificationAsync,\nEnqueueReminder
  note over API_NOTIF_OUTBOX: Only attaches OutboxMessage to the same AppDbContext, without saving:\nbooking_confirmed; owner_new_booking if the club wants it;\nbooking_reminder due at startsAt − 3 h, if still in the future.
  API_BOOK_SINGLE -> API_BOOK_STORE : TryAddAsync(booking)
  API_BOOK_STORE -> C_DB : One SaveChanges: INSERT bookings and INSERT outbox_messages [SQL]
  alt bookings_no_overlap refuses
    C_DB --> API_BOOK_STORE : SQLSTATE 23P01 (exclusion_violation)
    API_BOOK_STORE -> API_BOOK_STORE : Detaches the Added entries (booking and messages); Information log\nwithout the player
    API_BOOK_STORE --> API_BOOK_SINGLE : false
    CC_LOCK -> C_DB : No commit: the scope is disposed → ROLLBACK [SQL]
    API_BOOK_SINGLE --> WEB_F_BOOKING : 409 slot_taken
  else inserted
    API_BOOK_SINGLE -> CC_LOCK : scope.CommitAsync
    CC_LOCK -> C_DB : COMMIT: booking and emails together; the lock is released [SQL]
    API_BOOK_SINGLE --> WEB_F_BOOKING : 201 Created, Location: /api/bookings/{id}
  end
end
@enduml
